  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please allow us to set custom images for Avatar and world thumbnails without the need to modify any SDK script's code.\nThis post is a response/linked to https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/sdktransparent-avatar-images as the only current way to make transparent images can get you banned as it requires editing one or two sdk csharps, even though some creators still use this method.\n*The want to use a custom Image should not get you banned.*\nUsing the VRC Preview cam is really annoying in most cases. Even with Tools like Pumkins Avatar tools or overriding the RenderTexture just by hand.\n**Maybe this can get linked to the upcoming \"Gallery\" feature so that you can use such thumbnails in Unity/the client for the avatars.**",
